# Overview

This project follows the Applifting frontend playbook as the **primary source of truth** for frontend best practices:

- https://applifting.github.io/frontend-playbook/

All other rule files in `.cursor/rules` (for example `architecture.mdc`, `coding-style-next-react.mdc`, `env-and-config.mdc`, `testing.mdc`) **extend these rules** and may add project-specific details. They should only override the playbook when explicitly stated.
